This software downloads and analyses public data published by the NYC Taxi & Limousine Commission,
NYC Open Data and NOAA NCEI. That data is not part of this repository and is subject to its
publishers' terms; see docs/DATA_SOURCES.md. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
those organisations.

Third-party software is used under its own licenses (DuckDB, pandas, NumPy, SciPy, PyArrow,
LightGBM, FastAPI, Pydantic, Uvicorn, HTTPX, React, Recharts, Vite and others); see their
distributions for license texts.
